 "transcript": "I'm going to be honest with you. This probably isn't the first funding company you've seen an ad from, and it's probably not going to be the last. But almost every one of them is working off information that's about 80% right, and the 20% they're missing decides how much funding you actually get. Look up how long most of them have been in business. They usually just got started. They bought a course for the finance and mentorship from one of those big companies selling them, and those guys have no idea what they're doing either. Here's a perfect example. There are 13 hidden data points banks look at before they decide how much to approve you for. Things like your name, your addresses, and your employers match you in every single report. If they don't match, you get approved for less. And most of these companies never even check. They also miss how to set up more companies and fund every one of them off of the same personal file. And some of them run credit sweeps, which is illegal and puts your whole file and your freedom at risk. So what you get from them is the recycled information the whole industry runs on. And if that information happens to fit your file, you get funded. And if it doesn't, you walk away with a few small approvals and a report full of inquiries. We're never going to burn your file or just to close a deal. So if your file isn't ready, we won't take out. We won't take you on as a funding client. We'll give you the steps to get qualified or the education to make the right decisions with your credit. When your file is ready, we'll get you the maximum amount of funding as quickly as possible. With the strategies that have been proven to work, I've been in this industry for 10 years. And our system has collected thousands of data points from hundreds of files. That's where the other 20% comes from. Click below and book a call. And we'll keep it real with you about how much funding you actually qualify for right now.",
